  "details": "Previously in VRChat, we could use the rshift+backquote+1 to 3 options. Since you guys have gutted the debug menu from the game by default, we now have to rely on adding it as a launch option. The problem with this is that there is no way to call   --enable-debug-gui from CLI when launching into a test world, for example, as VRC_Triggers do not seem to work while testing in Unity. \nPlease allow us to enable the debug ui via launch parameters for VRChat. And if this is already doable - how?",
